// "Change the text of target permanent by replacing all instances of one color
// word with another or one basic land type with another. (This effect lasts
// indefinitely.)" [CR#612.2]: the kind of word and both words are the
// caster's choice as the effect applies.
SingleFaced(face: (
    characteristics: (
        name: "Mind Bend",
        cost: [Blue],
        types: [Instant],
        text: [
            spell(establish(textChange(target(permanent), replaceWord([Color, Subtype(host: Land)])))),
        ],
    ),
))
